//RS //! Backend-neutral web module swap facts and transaction state.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module deliberately stops at typed state. It does not know about a
//RS //! browser, JavaScript, DOM rendering, or a network. A later `Session` or
//RS //! `WebHost` adapter can turn a committed receipt into those effects without
//RS //! re-deciding compatibility or retention.
